---
import { opportunities } from '../../lib/clients/wheeler-backlinks';
const scorecard = [
 ['Referring domains, raw count','2','546','45'],
 ['Genuine referring domains','2','4','3'],
 ['Automated spam domains','0','About 537','About 40'],
 ['Toxic links needing action','None','Not Wheeler’s site','Only relevant if redirected'],
 ['Disavow file needed','No','Not applicable','Not applicable'],
 ['Anchor text','1 branded URL and 1 image link','Dominated by link-selling spam text','Partly link-selling spam text']
];
const types = [
 ['Link-selling spam','515','Automated pages that insert domains into link-building advertisements.','onvaxs.com; 888ph.bonus.online'],
 ['URL-shortener and website-report pages','21','Auto-generated domain reports and shortener pages.','bye.fyi/report; anchorurl.cloud/share; urls-shortener.eu; screenshots.wiki'],
 ['Auto-generated rank pages','5','Throwaway pages on free hosting.','global-ranks.pages.dev; huldra.pages.dev'],
 ['Same-owner redirect','1','The other business’s alternate domain.','wheelersupply.com'],
 ['Genuine','4','One editorial article and three business directories.','buildsteel.org; yellowpages.com; superpages.com; dexknows.com']
];
---
<div class="backlink-audit">
  <header class="backlink-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEO &amp; GEO / BACKLINKS</p><h1>Backlink audit</h1><p class="backlink-domain">getwheelersteel.com</p><p class="backlink-lead">A clean starting point. Build authority through new industry coverage of Wheeler’s current work, plus consistent listings.</p></div><div class="audit-meta"><strong>Last updated: October 6, 2026</strong><span>Source: DataForSEO backlink index,<br />plus manual page checks</span><a href="#backlink-opportunities">View next actions ↓</a></div></header>
  <div class="audit-highlights"><div><span>WHEELER</span><strong>2 <small>genuine domains</small></strong><p>2 total · 0 automated spam</p></div><div><span>WHEELERSTEELSUPPLY.COM</span><strong>4 <small>genuine domains</small></strong><p>546 total · about 537 automated spam</p></div><div><span>DON’S OLDER WEBSITE</span><a class="audit-domain-link" href="http://donwheelerconstruction.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">donwheelerconstruction.com ↗</a><strong>3 <small>genuine domains</small></strong><p>45 total · about 40 automated spam</p></div></div>
  <aside class="audit-ranking-context" aria-labelledby="ranking-context-heading"><h2 id="ranking-context-heading">Why the established Wheeler website can rank ahead today</h2><p><strong>It has a head start.</strong> The older website has had more time to establish its pages, business mentions and relevant links. It is reasonable to expect that established presence to lead a new website in some Google results, especially searches for the Wheeler name.</p><p><strong>The 546-domain total is not 546 useful endorsements.</strong> This audit identifies four genuine referring domains versus Wheeler’s two. The priority is to connect credible coverage to the correct company and build relevant authority. This audit does not establish rankings across every search.</p></aside>
  <div class="audit-overview-grid">
    <section class="audit-panel audit-profile" aria-labelledby="link-profile-heading"><div class="audit-panel-heading"><h2 id="link-profile-heading">The link profile</h2><span class="audit-status done">No toxic links for Wheeler</span></div><p class="audit-note">Compare genuine links, not just raw totals.</p><div class="audit-table-wrap"><table class="audit-scorecard"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Wheeler</th><th scope="col">wheelersteelsupply.com</th><th scope="col">Don’s older site</th></tr></thead><tbody>{scorecard.map(row=><tr>{row.map((cell,index)=>index===0?<th scope="row">{cell}</th>:<td data-label={['Metric','Wheeler','wheelersteelsupply.com','Don’s older site'][index]}>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
    <section class="audit-panel audit-priorities"><p class="eyebrow">PRIORITY ACTIONS</p><h2>Start here this month</h2><ol class="audit-quick-wins"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Confirm Google Search Console</strong><p>Send access to Miguel.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Create consistent directory listings</strong><p>Add Wheeler to YellowPages, Superpages and DexKnows with matching business details.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Link from Don’s older website</strong><p>Add a plain link to Wheeler’s current website, if Don controls the older site.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Pitch a new BuildSteel / SFIA story</strong><p>Highlight Wheeler Residential’s current rebuild work, IBS 2027 or the October 11 event.</p></div></li></ol><a class="audit-action-link" href="#backlink-opportunities">See all 18 opportunities ↓</a></section>
  </div>
  <section class="audit-panel audit-action-panel" id="backlink-opportunities" aria-labelledby="backlink-opportunities-heading"><div class="audit-panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE ACTION PLAN</p><h2 id="backlink-opportunities-heading">Backlink opportunities</h2><p class="audit-note">Ranked by priority. Open means proposed, not completed.</p></div><div class="audit-filter"><label for="backlink-status-filter">Show status</label><select id="backlink-status-filter"><option value="all">All opportunities</option><option value="Done">Done</option><option value="Open">Open</option><option value="No action">No action</option><option value="To check">To check</option></select></div></div><p id="backlink-filter-count" class="audit-result-count" role="status">18 opportunities</p><div class="audit-table-wrap"><table class="audit-opportunity-table"><colgroup><col class="opportunity-checkbox-col" /><col class="opportunity-name-col" /><col class="opportunity-action-col" /><col class="opportunity-status-col" /></colgroup><thead><tr><th scope="col">Done</th><th scope="col">Opportunity &amp; current finding</th><th scope="col">Next action</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{opportunities.map((item,index)=><tr data-backlink-id={item.id} data-initial-status={item.status} data-backlink-status={item.status} id={`backlink-opportunity-${item.id}`}><td class="audit-completion">{item.status!=='No action'&&<label><input type="checkbox" data-backlink-checkbox={item.id} checked={item.status==='Done'} aria-label={`Mark ${item.title} as done`} /></label>}</td><th scope="row"><div class="audit-opportunity-name"><span class="audit-number">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div>{item.url?<a href={item.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{item.title} ↗</a>:<strong>{item.title}</strong>}<p>{item.finding}</p>{item.links&&<div class="audit-directory-links">{item.links.map(link=><a href={link.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{link.name} ↗</a>)}</div>}</div></div></th><td data-label="Next action" class="audit-next-action"><strong>{item.action}</strong>{item.note&&item.id!==5&&<small>{item.note}</small>}</td><td data-label="Status"><span data-backlink-badge class:list={['audit-status',item.status==='Done'?'done':item.status==='No action'?'no-action':item.status==='Open'?'open':'check']}>{item.status}</span></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p id="backlink-save-status" class="audit-note" role="status" hidden></p><button id="retry-backlink-save" type="button" hidden>Retry saving</button><p class="audit-note">Findings and statuses are from the October 6 audit. Missing source links are marked for confirmation. Check an opportunity when completed. Completion is saved to the shared workspace.</p></section>
  <div class="audit-detail-grid">
    <section class="audit-panel"><div class="audit-panel-heading"><h2>Already in place</h2><span class="audit-status done">4 assets</span></div><div class="audit-existing"><article><span class="audit-status done">Done</span><h3><a href="https://business.palibu.org/rebuild-partners" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Palisades Rebuild Partners ↗</a></h3><p>A locally relevant business-directory link. Spam score 0, dofollow and a branded URL anchor.</p></article><article><span class="audit-status done">Done</span><h3><a href="https://www.buildersshow.com/Search/Exhibitor.aspx?id=1533073&year=2027" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IBS 2027 exhibitor listing ↗</a></h3><p>A clean trade-industry link. Dofollow, with an image-link anchor.</p></article><article><span class="audit-status done">Done</span><h3><a href="https://cfsei.memberclicks.net/index.php?option=com_community&view=profile&userid=2019503038" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CFSEI member profile ↗</a></h3><p>Names Wheeler Residential Steel Supply and its website. A profile mention, not an indexed backlink.</p></article><article><span class="audit-status done">Done</span><h3>Google Business Profile</h3><p>Already in place and managed by Wheeler’s team.</p></article></div><p class="audit-note">The two indexed links were first seen October 2 to 4, 2026.</p></section>
    <section class="audit-panel audit-explainer"><div class="audit-panel-heading"><h2>546 domains. Four genuine sources.</h2></div><p>The wheelersteelsupply.com indexed profile is mostly automated pages. Its genuine links consist of one editorial article and three directory listings.</p><div class="audit-table-wrap"><table class="audit-types"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Link type</th><th scope="col">Count</th></tr></thead><tbody>{types.map(row=><tr><th scope="row"><strong>{row[0]}</strong><p>{row[2]}</p><small>{row[3]}</small></th><td data-label="Count">{row[1]}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p class="audit-note">Automated spam links are aimed at almost every small business site without the owner’s involvement. These counts do not imply the competitor purchased links.</p><p class="audit-note">The categories total 546. The scorecard’s approximately 537 automated spam domains is an approximate classification. Search engines generally discount automated spam links.</p></section>
    <section class="audit-panel audit-callout"><p class="eyebrow">KEEP THE PROFILE CLEAN</p><h2>Actions to avoid</h2><ul><li><strong>Do not ask anyone to change historical articles or event pages.</strong> Past coverage correctly names the company Don worked with at the time. Update current bios and profiles when needed, and earn new links through new stories.</li><li><strong>Redirect Don’s older domain as part of this work.</strong> About 40 of its 45 referring domains are classified as automated spam. Start with a plain link and assess any migration separately.</li><li><strong>Create a disavow file for Wheeler.</strong> The audit found no toxic links needing action.</li><li><strong>Buy links or join link schemes.</strong> Automated link-selling pages do not provide useful authority.</li><li><strong>Seek changes to the competitor’s unrelated links.</strong> Historical coverage stays unchanged. Focus on current profiles and new coverage.</li></ul></section>
    <section class="audit-panel"><h2>Why we leave older coverage as it is</h2><p>Past articles and event pages describe Don’s work and company at that time. They remain valid historical coverage. Current bios and profiles can reflect his role today; new stories should introduce Wheeler Residential’s current work and website.</p></section>
  </div>
</div>
